silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_14_validation_and_deployment_sections_04_cross_paper_bridge_evidence_provenance_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'CrossPaperBridgeEvidenceProvenanceYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Cross-Paper Bridge: Evidence Provenance (Paper 28)', the cocone_factorisation arrow witnesses a typed leg between Mittens and VetCarePlan_77 under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure.; also, In 'Cross-Paper Bridge: Evidence Provenance (Paper 28)', the evidence_witness arrow witnesses a typed leg between VetRecord and Mittens under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure." .
